================================================================================
FEFF 8.5L
================================================================================

feffgpu is a re-implementation in Python of the EXAFS pipeline of FEFF 8.5L (the
open-source `feff85exafs` distribution, https://github.com/xraypy/feff85exafs).
Its algorithms, input format and file formats follow FEFF 8.5L. As that
distribution's license requires of modified versions, this software carries the
marking:

    Based on or developed using Distribution: FEFF8.5L
    Copyright (c) [2013] University of Washington

FEFF's Fortran source is not distributed in this repository. The file
`fortran/feff85exafs_ltot80.patch` is a patch against `feff85exafs` that only
enlarges fixed array dimensions; it contains the changed lines and their
context lines from FEFF 8.5L. The free-atom table
(`src/feffgpu/data/atoms`) and the files under `tests/data/` and
`data/validation/` were produced by running FEFF 8.5L. The notice, conditions and disclaimer of FEFF 8.5L are retained below.

