================================================================================
EvAX
================================================================================

The reverse Monte Carlo search in `feffgpu.rmc` follows the rules of the
evolutionary algorithm of EvAX (J. Timoshenko and A. Kuzmin), as published and as
implemented in EvAX. No EvAX source code is contained in or required by this
software. Please cite EvAX when you use `feffgpu.rmc`; the references are listed
in README.md and CITATION.cff.

================================================================================
MD-EXAFS
================================================================================

`feffgpu.md` continues the program MD-EXAFS
(https://github.com/Joint-Photon-Sciences-Institute/MD-EXAFS, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025 MD-EXAFS Contributors): its purpose, its configuration
sections and its analysis tools were the model for this implementation.
